# What an image build receives from brand/. Four images take this
# directory as the build context named brand: media-operator's player,
# idle, and display images, and library-operator's media browser. They
# copy the liken-iced crate's manifest and sources, the mark and the
# stylesheet that the crate reads when it compiles, and the fonts.
#
# So this file keeps those paths and leaves out every other path: the
# Hugo theme, the voice rules, the site tools, their tests, and what a
# workstation writes, such as the gigabytes of iced/target/. The CI
# generator reads this file too, and rebuilds the four images only for
# a change to a path that it keeps. A Dockerfile that copies another
# path from brand fails until the path is added here.
*
!fonts/
!iced/Cargo.toml
!iced/Cargo.lock
!iced/src/
!liken.svg
!liken.css
